The audit writer lacks sequence numbers and gap alerts, and its hashes are never verified. I also found a redaction bypass: a field such as `{"password": "plain-secret"}` keeps its value because dictionary keys aren’t used when redacting. Retention is unclear because the database’s lifecycle configuration is outside this repo. High-impact tool calls await audit writes before execution.
